{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>You shall guard your priesthood.</b> So that no outsider draw near to priestly service, as happened with Uzziah (2 Chronicles 26:16)." "<b>And you shall serve.</b> And likewise you shall guard, so that no outsider draw near to the service that you perform — and this too requires guarding." "<b>The service of a gift I give your priesthood.</b> The priestly service incumbent upon you alone I give and establish as a gift of honor and preeminence in the eyes of all people; and so all will desire it — therefore you must guard it well."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:23.898404200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}